      "explanation": {
        "en": "A complete Arabic statement: definite noun (subject) + indefinite word (predicate). There is no word for \"is\". الْكِتَابُ (the book) + جَدِيدٌ (new) = \"The book is new.\" You will build these sentences in Lesson 4.",
